<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thirteen stocks fell, one rose and four were flat in 18.1-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Friday, with the WIG 20 index falling 1.7 percent to 1,592.7 points.</p>
<p>The remaining five stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 2.8 percent to 148 zlotys in a 15.6-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
